## 5. Danh sách commit trên nhánh a1-api-mcp
- `60573cd`: feat(core): update default model chains, worker prompt, and waiting_quota wakeups
- `bdb6146`: feat(api): implement security, service layer, HTTP API, SSE, and PTY login
- `23a0e1f`: feat(mcp): implement MCP server with stdio transport and hub_* tools
- `99515cd`: feat(cli): implement CLI commands and installation scripts
- `19e5b95`: feat(daemon): support AGENTHUB_FAKE_ENGINE environment variable
